                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This morning, the Biden admin.\u2019s head of Medicaid, who oversees $500 billion of your taxpayer dollars per year, was unable or simply unwilling to answer my specific, basic questions concerning improper payments made by Medicaid last year totaling $50 billion and mandatory staffing ratios for nursing homes that most rural areas cannot meet.\n\nWatch\ud83d\udc47",
