                "text": "From @politico: Biden admin to spend billions to blunt spike in Medicare drug premiums\n\nWhen the Biden-Harris administration pushed for the so-called \u2018Inflation Reduction Act\u2019, we sounded the alarm this would happen. We\u2019re over $35 trillion in debt; we must be extremely mindful of how we spend taxpayer dollars. It\u2019s clear that\u2019s not a priority for the Biden-Harris administration.\n\nhttps://t.co/fwdwRRFO2F",
